  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PHP 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bazunya shibigelile kwidohya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ūlū būlīho būganikīji bose bose mulī Kilisito, nūūlū būtogwa bose bose ūbo būshikile kūlūngūja, nūūlū būsangī bose bose mulī Moyo, nūūlū kwisaatwa na kwikūlīlwa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "būshikīlījagi ū būyegi bone. Bizagi na widomanīja ū mu maganiko, hama mubize na būtogwa bo mbika īmò; nīyo hangī mubize nang'holò īmò na long'we īmò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kwīta mhayo mu kūkooba ikūjo nūūlū mu wikumīlīja, alīyo mubize bidohya, būlī ng'wene ibone gīkī alī ha sīlīlī ya biye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama yaya kūyūdīlīla būlī munhū yakwe dūhū, ng'ūdīlīla nī ya bangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ning'we bizagi nalyo ī liganiko īlo walī nalyo ū Kilisito Yesu;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwaaka gītī isana mu sī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose hū kūhaya gīkī badūgū bane batogwa, ongejagi ū kūbiza bigwi, gīt'ūmo mukwītīlaga na kale, ītī kūgonga nabize nalīho dūhū ū nene, alīyo ī no no no ī haha aho natīho; būlwīlīlagi bing'we benekīlī ū būpīji wing'we, mu logohano na kūdetema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū Mulungu akūtūmamaga ū mu bing'we, hū ng'wene ūyo akūng'winhaga būkalalwa, hamò na būdūla bo kwīta īyo yīnyegije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ng'ūbeeja pyī ī yose mu būtūduguma nūūlū halalī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mubize mutī na shilingo nūūlū būbi, baana ba ng'wa Mulungu abo batī na shisembo, nūūlū ū ng'wikanza īlo mukwikalaga hamò na shibyalīlwe shikenaagūkile na shilyūngūmile; īsho mukūng'weka ng'wekaga musho gītī kūng'weka kwa sonda mu sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangī nīyo gūhandatīlagi ū mhayo gwa būpanga, nalapandīke sha kūyegela a ha lūshikū lo ng'wa Kilisito, gīkī gashinaga natanogile kūtagamba dalali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī haha nūūlū būkitwa ū būpanga bone gītī shitambo na shitūmamīlo kūlwa nguno ya kūzunya kwing'we, nalī na būyegi; hangī nalīyega hamò ning'we pye a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a bing'we shing'wigeleelilwe kūyega, na ng'hana yegagi hamò nane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Timotheo na Epafradito",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, nalī na kwisagīlwa mulī Seeba Yesu gīkī, nakūntūma Timotheo ize wangū ū kū bing'we, nane nīmane ī mihayo ying'we, nayege. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno natī na munhū ūngī wa kūlenganīla nang'hwe, ūyo adūgije kwīdīlīla mu welwa ng'holò ī mihayo ying'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a bangī bakwikoobelaga yabo dūhū, ītī ya ng'wa Kilisito Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū wei muumanile ī nhūngwa jakwe, nī gīkī ū nene nū wei twalī hamò ū mu kūgūtūmama ū nīmo gwa Ng'hūlū Jawiza, gītī munhū na ng'witūnja wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, nalī na ng'hūmbū ja kūntūma wangū ūlū nalamane ūmo īlījīla ī mihayo yane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nalī na kūsanya mulī Seeba gīkī, nū nene natūdīla ū kwiza ko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ī haha īlīnigeleelwa nantūme atonge ū kwiza koi ū ndūgū wane ū Epafradito, ū ntūmami na nshilikale ng'wichane; ūyo alī ntūng'wa wing'we kūlwa kūnigunanha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo wamukūmbūlile no pye a bose, hama akūkoyaga ū mu maganiko īkī ng'walī ng'wigwile gīkī walī wasaatile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana walī wasaatile no, nīyo lya mandetendete hihī na kūcha, gwike ū Mulungu akankūlīlwa, hangī nīyo ītī wei dūhū, alīyo nū nene ng'wenekīlī, gīkī natizūpīnīhala nakakīlanīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, ī haha nalīntūma hangī ū kū bing'we, mu kwisagīlwa kūtaale gīkī mukūyega ūlū mulamone, nane būnigehele ū būpīna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hū kūhaya ng'wanukūlagi mulī Seeba na būyegi bose; nīyo a banhū ba mbika īlī gīko ng'ūbakūja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno walī wendil'ūcha kūlwa nīmo go ng'wa Kilisito, akaweega ū būpanga bokwe gīkī ayīshikīlīje īyo mukalebya ho a bing'we ū mu kūnigunanha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
